//! # aidl_compat
//!
//! AOSP AIDL Interface Integration and Rust Traits Compatibility Crate for AndroidWebGPU.
//! Provides traits, types, macros, and smart pointer wrappers enabling code generated by
//! official AOSP `aidl --lang=rust` to build and execute cleanly.

